/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This comprehensive course delves into the practical application of Machine Learning \(ML\) and Deep Learning \(DL\) in real-world scenarios. The curriculum covers various topics including supervised, unsupervised, and reinforcement learning algorithms, with a strong focus on neural networks and deep learning architectures like Convolutional Neural Networks \(CNN\), Recurrent Neural Networks \(RNN\), and Long Short-Term Memory \(LSTM\).)
